      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head>Quadr II Praef 5</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Quadr II Praef 5" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="542–543" ed="#liebermann"/>Hinc a primeuo mundi nascentis exordio quos rerum Deus artifex equa libertate ditauerat, inobedientie motus inflammantis eiecit; et qui celi Dominum ferre non poterant, hominum seruiunt prauitate distincti, continuis malorum prosecutionibus in deteriora queque proiecti.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">New row (October 2026): Liebermann’s text transcribed from Gesetze I p. 542–543 (two independent readings of the page images, differences settled against the page)</note>
      </div>
